message: "Bu yazılımı kullanırsanız lütfen aşağıdaki künyeyle atıf yapın. If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Telekumanda"
abstract: >-
  Remote control for the AI coding agents running on a desktop computer:
  Claude Code, Codex and Antigravity sessions are started, followed
  and approved from an Android phone or a browser. It consists of a Kotlin and
  Jetpack Compose Android app and a Node.js bridge server that runs on the PC,
  authenticates requests with a bearer token or per-device key, and connects
  the phone UI to the agent backends over HTTP and WebSocket.
